# A composite with two subtracks and a track with no parent.  Links as usual.
track loneTrack
shortLabel lone
longLabel A track with no parent
type bed 3

track comp
compositeTrack on
shortLabel comp
longLabel A composite
type bed 3

track compSubA
parent comp on
shortLabel sub A
longLabel Subtrack A
type bed 3

track compSubB
parent comp
shortLabel sub B
longLabel Subtrack B
type bed 3
